{
  "nodes": [
    {"id":"root","type":"text","x":0,"y":0,"width":520,"height":300,"color":"4","text":"# 674-121｜Agency Control\n## 人类介入与 AI 自主执行控制层\n\n核心问题：AI 什么时候可以自主连续执行？什么时候集中交给 74 审核？什么时候必须停止？\n\n状态：4/4 研究轮次完成\nTHEORY = DONE｜RULE = DONE｜SYSTEM_DESIGN = DONE\nIMPLEMENTATION = TODO｜EMPIRICAL_VALIDATION = TODO"},
    {"id":"factors","type":"text","x":-760,"y":-380,"width":440,"height":280,"color":"5","text":"# 四因子\n\nconfidence｜置信度\nreversibility｜可逆性\npreference-load｜审美/偏好负载\nblast-radius｜错误影响范围\n\n原则：错误成本决定授权等级。"},
    {"id":"gate","type":"text","x":0,"y":-500,"width":440,"height":230,"color":"4","text":"# Agency Gate\n\n专业 Agent 给出候选与判断\n→ 四因子评估\n→ 决定下一步执行权\n\nAgent 不允许高风险场景中同时“提出方案 + 自审 + 放行”。"},
    {"id":"auto","type":"text","x":-700,"y":300,"width":360,"height":230,"color":"5","text":"# AUTO\n\n高置信｜高可逆｜低偏好负载｜小影响范围\n\n继续执行，不逐步询问 74。\n例：索引、状态同步、manifest、低风险整理。"},
    {"id":"review","type":"text","x":0,"y":420,"width":400,"height":260,"color":"3","text":"# REVIEW\n\n高 preference-load 或关键选择\n→ REVIEW_QUEUE\n→ 集中给 74 一次审核\n\n等待 74 ≠ 系统停机；调度器继续寻找 AUTO 旁路任务。"},
    {"id":"stop","type":"text","x":700,"y":300,"width":360,"height":230,"color":"1","text":"# STOP\n\n低置信 + 高影响\n不可逆 / 输入来源不明 / 关键路径高风险\n\n只有关键路径无旁路时，才形成真正全局阻塞。"},
    {"id":"packet","type":"text","x":700,"y":-380,"width":430,"height":300,"color":"6","text":"# Agency Packet\n\nactor\nconfidence\nreversibility\npreference_load\nblast_radius\nagency_mode = AUTO / REVIEW / STOP\nreason\nnext_action\nreview_queue\n\nstatus 表示做到哪；agency_mode 表示谁有下一步执行权。"},
    {"id":"integration","type":"text","x":-760,"y":760,"width":460,"height":300,"color":"4","text":"# 系统接口\n\n专业 Agent → Agency Gate → 执行 Agent → QA\n→ Linear 状态回写 → 调度器领取下一项\n\n现有状态机：\ndraft → queued → running → review → accepted / rerun / rejected → locked"},
    {"id":"human","type":"text","x":0,"y":820,"width":440,"height":250,"color":"3","text":"# 74 的位置\n\n74 不是 Worker。\n74 不是逐步审批器。\n74 是高 preference-load、高影响或不可逆决策节点。\n\n目标：把人工介入从“每一步”压缩成“关键批次审核”。"},
    {"id":"production","type":"text","x":700,"y":760,"width":450,"height":280,"color":"4","text":"# 与 F｜工业与生产 的接口\n\nF：怎样稳定、快速、连续、可复现地生产。\n121：生产过程中谁拥有下一步执行权。\n\n生产流程 → 121 授权控制 → Agent / Worker / CODEX IMAGE → QA → 下一循环"},
    {"id":"validation","type":"text","x":0,"y":1200,"width":540,"height":300,"color":"2","text":"# 工程验证｜TODO\n\n1. 不必要人工介入率是否下降？\n2. 需要 74 的审核能否真正批量集中？\n3. AUTO 连续运行时错误是否向下游扩散？\n\n规则设计已收束 ≠ 整个问题实证解决。\n下一阶段：implementation + log replay + empirical validation。"}
  ],
  "edges": [
    {"id":"e1","fromNode":"factors","toNode":"gate","label":"INPUT","fromSide":"right","toSide":"left"},
